<title>USA: Yields rise on Bond Buyer's weekly indices.</title>
<headline>Yields rise on Bond Buyer's weekly indices.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yields on the Bond Buyer municipal bond indices rose this week.</p>
<p>The yield on the 20-bond index of general obligation bonds calculated Thursday, Dec 19, was 5.67 percent, up one basis point from last week.</p>
<p>The yield on the 11-bond index of GO bonds was 5.57 percent, also up one basis point from last week.</p>
<p>The yield on the 30-year revenue bond index was 5.95 percent, two basis points higher than last week.</p>
<p>20 Bond Index			5.67%   5.66%  12/19/96</p>
<p>11 Bond index			5.57%   5.56%  12/19/96</p>
<p>Revenue Bond Index		 5.95%   5.93%  12/19/96</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
